%%{init: {"sequence": {"actorMargin": 25, "width": 120, "diagramMarginX": 10, "messageMargin": 18}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Viewer or owner
    actor Op as Operator
    participant API as API function
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Job as Analyse job
    participant Rek as Rekognition
    participant St as status function

    Job->>Job: 1 frame per 5 s,<br/>at most 120<br/>#nbsp;
    Job->>Rek: DetectModerationLabels,<br/>4 at a time<br/>#nbsp;
    Rek-->>Job: Labels, confidence
    Job->>Job: Policy: approved,<br/>review or removed<br/>#nbsp;
    Job-->>St: Result in the work bucket,<br/>read by Publish<br/>#nbsp;
    St->>DB: READY with the verdict
    Note over DB,St: Review and removed:<br/>in no listing

    opt A viewer reports
        User->>API: POST /v1/videos/:id/report
        API->>DB: Report, one open<br/>per viewer, recount<br/>#nbsp;
    end

    Op->>API: GET /v1/admin/queue
    API-->>Op: Held and reported videos
    Op->>API: POST .../decision,<br/>decision and reason code<br/>#nbsp;
    API->>DB: Keep the machine verdict,<br/>apply, close reports<br/>#nbsp;
    API->>DB: Append a<br/>moderation event<br/>#nbsp;

    opt Owner appeals
        User->>API: POST /v1/videos/:id/appeal
        API->>DB: Appeal, one open<br/>per video<br/>#nbsp;
        Op->>API: POST /v1/admin/<br/>appeals/:id/decision<br/>#nbsp;
        alt Upheld
            API->>DB: Approve: restored
        else Rejected
            API->>DB: Decision kept
        end
    end
